92186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520404 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520404 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186520091 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520404 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "7e463a5a-0bf7-5c15-8a84-e8fb513aab4c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520410 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186520153 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520410 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520410 #edb/ref 1077 "field-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520410 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186520153 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520410 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "8b7fd03c-605a-5e8e-8867-8d3e258ab8cf" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520457 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186520397 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520457 #edb/ref 1069 "q-71952" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520457 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520457 #edb/ref 1071 "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{{x}^{3}-2x}}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520457 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "321f22b7-0ca5-594c-82a7-c5cf5cf23fad" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520457 #edb/ref 1074 "Let $g(x)={x}^{3}-2x$ and $f(g(x))=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{g}}=2{g}^{-1/2}.$ \n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(g(x)) & =2({g}^{-1/2})^{′}=-2\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{g}^{-3/2}=-\\frac{1}{{g}^{3/2}}, \\\\ {g}^{′}(x) & =({x}^{3}-2x)^{′}=3{x}^{2}-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, using the chain rule, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & ={f}^{′}(g(x))\\cdot {g}^{′}(x) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{{g}^{3/2}}\\cdot (3{x}^{2}-2) \\\\  & =-\\frac{3{x}^{2}-2}{{g}^{3/2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3{x}^{2}-2}{\\sqrt{({x}^{3}-2x)^{3}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520473 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186520387 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520473 #edb/ref 1069 "q-107296" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520473 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520473 #edb/ref 1071 "Given that $f(x)={(1-3x)}^{8},$ find ${f}^{′}(x).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520473 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "73597027-954f-5bff-8c64-de058a3fe822" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520473 #edb/ref 1074 "Let $g(x)=1-3x$ and $f(g(x))=g(x)^{8}.$ \n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(g(x)) & =({g}^{8})^{′}=8{g}^{7}, \\\\ {g}^{′}(x) & =(1-3x)^{′}=-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, using the chain rule, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & ={f}^{′}(g(x))\\cdot {g}^{′}(x) \\\\  & =8{g}^{7}\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =-24(1-3x)^{7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520484 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186520410 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520484 #edb/ref 1069 "q-314207" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520484 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520484 #edb/ref 1071 "Given that $f(x)={({x}^{4}-3{x}^{3})}^{2},$ find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=2({x}^{4}-3{x}^{3})($\n{{field-1}}\n$)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520484 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "930f9486-b8c5-5ccf-b917-a4806acde6bf" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520484 #edb/ref 1074 "Let $g(x)={x}^{4}-3{x}^{3}$ and $f(g(x))=g(x)^{2}.$ \n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(g(x)) & =({g}^{2})^{′}=2g, \\\\ {g}^{′}(x) & =({x}^{4}-3{x}^{3})^{′}=4{x}^{3}-9{x}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, using the chain rule, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & ={f}^{′}(g(x))\\cdot {g}^{′}(x) \\\\  & =2g\\cdot (4{x}^{3}-9{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =2({x}^{4}-3{x}^{3})(\\,4{x}^{3}-9{x}^{2}\\,).\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520487 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186520404 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520487 #edb/ref 1069 "q-107303" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520487 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520487 #edb/ref 1071 "Given that $y=\\sqrt{2x-1},$ find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520487 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "98cde390-f268-5ffd-9f2f-31f016a0c432" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520487 #edb/ref 1074 "We use the chain rule in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}.\n$$\n\nLet $u=2x-1.$ Then $y=\\sqrt{u}={u}^{1/2}.$ Differentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}=\\frac{1}{2}{u}^{-1/2}=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the two together gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}}\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2x-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520516 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186520382 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520516 #edb/ref 1069 "q-314192" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520516 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520516 #edb/ref 1071 "The slope of the tangent to the curve $y=\\sqrt{4x+1}$ at the point where $x=0$ is{{field-1}}." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520516 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "fa666076-05a3-50c7-be3d-b7a39d6d4f55" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520516 #edb/ref 1074 "To find the slope at a given point, we have to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ at that point.\n\nWe use the chain rule in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}.\n$$\n\nLet $u=4x+1.$ Then $y=\\sqrt{u}.$ Differentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}},\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=4.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the two together gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}}\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{2\\sqrt{4x+1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $x=0,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=0} & ={(\\frac{4}{2\\sqrt{4x+1}})|}_{x=0} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{2\\sqrt{4(0)+1}} \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520538 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "35b3efb8-a2d4-59c0-b538-ee4b244189e0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520538 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186520484 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520543 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186520579 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520543 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "4350c72e-f9bd-5210-90fd-d37e9cc293c0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520543 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186520473 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520551 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186520538 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520551 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "51f59503-df73-54cc-af64-3dcb163fe7d6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520551 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186520516 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520579 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186520551 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520579 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "828caf19-ec46-5c3a-829e-707d043329c0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520579 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186520487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520608 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186520543 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520608 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "dcb12c9b-27b2-535b-bf95-11fa19d50067" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186520608 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186520457 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
